# Clone copying Tarmogoyf copies its characteristic-defining ability with the rest (CR 707.2, 604.3): on turn 3, with
# Lightning Bolt (an instant) and Bot2's discarded Island (a land) in graveyards, both are 2/3. On turn 5 Humility makes
# them creatures with no abilities and base power and toughness 1/1 (layer 6 takes the defining ability, so layer 7a has
# nothing to apply, and 7b sets 1/1): both 1/1. On turn 7 Bot1 disenchants Humility, and the defining ability is back: with
# an instant, a land and an enchantment (Humility) among the graveyards' cards, both are 3/4 (Disenchant, another instant,
# adds no type).

